N        EQU   16
KEY      EQU   1000
DELTA    EQU   1100
K        EQU   1200
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT1  N+1/2       C1. Initialize. i ← ⌊(N + 1)/2⌋.
         ENT2  2           j ← 2.
         LDA   K
         JMP   2F
3H       JE    SUCCESS     Jump if K = Ki.
         J3Z   FAILURE     Jump if DELTA[j] = 0.
         DEC1  0,3         C3. Decrease i.
5H       INC2  1           j ← j + 1.
2H       LD3   DELTA,2     C2. Compare.
         CMPA  KEY,1
         JLE   3B          Jump if K ≤ Ki.
         INC1  0,3         C4. Increase i.
         J3NZ  5B          Jump if DELTA[j] ≠ 0.
FAILURE  EQU   *           Exit if not in table.
         ENTA  0
         HLT
SUCCESS  ENTA  0,1
         HLT
         END   START
